  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Celebration event for International Forest Day 21 March 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guin&#xe9;e Ecologie and Herbier National de Guin&#xe9;e propose a school&#x2019;s event for International Forest Day on 21 March 2025 which will include the schools participating in the environmental education programme under the conservation of threatened trees project in Guin&#xe9;e Maritime. The activities proposed would be centred around the eco-clubs already in place in the ten schools in Guin&#xe9;e Maritime to increase awareness of the role of forests in the fight against climate change, maintaining biodiversity and ecosystem services e.g. provision of food and water. It will also create a collaborative dynamic between ecological clubs for future actions.</narrative>
  </description>
